    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "These are a good start, but they feel a little bit like archetypes from an old movie. I want to make it feel more modern and grounded in a realistic urban landscape. To make the contrast even stronger, can you refine these characters by giving them specific ethnic or racial backgrounds? I want the underworld to feel like a diverse, multifaceted part of the city so the tension feels more authentic and \"real world.\"",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
