    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That definitely adds more flavor. I like how you're tying their personalities to their backgrounds. To really nail the \"noir\" feel, I want to make sure the visual descriptions and the way they carry themselves are distinctive. For each of them, can you write a short, intense scene—maybe just a paragraph each—where they are seen in their natural element? I want to see how their specific cultural and racial identity influences their movements, their speech patterns, and how they interact with the environment to show that \"gritty\" tension you mentioned.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
