      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Sal, leaning against a graffiti-scarred brick wall in a forgotten warehouse district, doesn't look at you; he just lets his heavy, thick-soled boots scrape a rhythm on the cracked concrete, the silence around him feeling heavy and territorial. Lola, draped in expensive, slightly too-tight designer clothes in a dimly lit, high-end club's back room, doesn't wait for you to speak, her eyes scanning the room with a practiced, dismissive flick, her cadence sharp and quick, like a perfectly aimed verbal jab. Whispers is huddled in the corner of a perpetually damp subway station, his movements jerky and economical, constantly checking over his shoulder, his rapid-fire speech peppered with local slang, as if the very air around him is trying to catch him.",
